---
import { url } from '../lib/utils';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---

<footer class="bg-ink text-on-navy on-dark">
  <div class="container-page grid gap-10 py-12 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]">
    <div>
      <img
        src={url('/images/kfec-logo-white.png')}
        alt="KFEC Kyungsung Finance & Economics Club"
        width="311"
        height="100"
        class="h-14 w-auto"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <p class="mt-5 text-sm">{site.koreanName} · {site.affiliation}</p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-6">
        KFEC의 리서치 자료는 학습 목적의 참고 자료이며 투자 권유가 아닙니다.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-3 md:items-end">
      <a
        href={site.cafeUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex min-w-[13rem] items-center justify-between gap-2 border border-on-navy px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-ink"
      >
        네이버 카페 바로가기<span class="sr-only"> (새 창)</span>
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8" /></svg>
      </a>
      <a
        href={site.instagramUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex min-w-[13rem] items-center justify-between gap-2 border border-on-navy px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-ink"
      >
        인스타그램 {site.instagram}<span class="sr-only"> (새 창)</span>
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8" /></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-white/15">
    <p class="container-page py-5 text-xs num">© 2026 KFEC. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
